==Differences between the movie and the manga==
* While {{Ash}}, {{an|Hoopa}}, [[Meray]], and [[Baraz]] are trying to escape the space-time distortion at the end of the story, Hoopa is able to escape temporarily by going through the ring with Baraz as he lives in [[Arche Valley]], but is forced back through as soon as Ash takes it. In the {{pkmn|movie}}, Baraz and Meray both try to bring Hoopa through the ring and fail, as the stipulation that Hoopa can pass through if accompanied by a resident of Arche Valley is not present.

